":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105983","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105983.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105983.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Complements #100470.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the scaling of multiple bezier animation keys to also scale the bezier handles along with it, which helps better preserve the shape of the curve as you scale it up/down.\r\n\r\nHere's a (somewhat contrived) example of what it looks like currently:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb14bcea-51b3-47ed-9080-3410d2ab8547\r\n\r\nAnd here's what it looks like with this PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d74676d2-ed0c-4823-ab15-9e549bb1694c\r\n\r\nAs you can hopefully see, the inherent shape of the selected curve is better preserved with this PR.\r\n\r\n~~Note that I deliberately exclude the left/in handle of the leftmost selected key, as well as the right/out handle of the rightmost selected key, since you could otherwise drastically change the shape of the connected curves as well.~~","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105983/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105983/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}